<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms to seek 5,000T of cottonseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms to seek 5,000T of cottonseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean feed mill companies will invite tenders for 5,000 tonnes of cottonseed meal by 3.00 p.m. (0600 GMT) on Tuesday, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>They said origin would be set based on the seller's option for delivery on December 30 to the western port city of Inchon.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
